description.desc:
While on the field, hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to charge then activate:
Throws a hammer at enemies on the field, dealing <color=#A6C5FD>Wind DMG</color>;
<color=#ffffff>[Wind Eye]</color> hit by this skill will be detonated, generating a small tornado that continuously tracks enemies and deals <color=#A6C5FD>Wind DMG</color>;
After using this skill, all other <color=#ffffff>[Wind Eye]</color> will be detonated;
During the skill's charge phase, Anti-Interrupt level is increased and <color=#ffffff>[Wind Eye]</color> on the field are continuously gathered;
During the skill's attack phase, Character is invulnerable.

With enough Energy, press <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> to activate:
Slides forward, dealing <color=#A6C5FD>Wind DMG</color>.
When <color=#ffffff>[Wind Energy]</color> is available, automatically chains into <color=#ffffff>[EX Special Attack: Wind Cannon]</color>;
When <color=#ffffff>[Wind Energy]</color> is not available, automatically chains into <color=#ffffff>[Basic Attack: Meteor Hammer]</color>;
Character is invulnerable during the skill's attack.

desc:
For every 30 Energy consumed, gain 1 <color=#ffffff>[Wind Energy]</color>. <color=#ffffff>[Wind Energy]</color> cap is 3.
When Roxy's initial DEF exceeds 1.2, each point of DEF above this threshold increases ATK by <color=#POSITIVE_WITH_GREYITE>5</color> and Impact by <color=#POSITIVE_WITH_GREYITE>3.2</color>, up to a maximum increase of <color=#POSITIVE_WITH_GREYITE>960</color> ATK and <color=#POSITIVE_WITH_GREYITE>60</color> Impact;
When CRIT Rate is at or above 65% during combat, Anomaly Buildup Rate increases by <color=#POSITIVE_WITH_GREYITE>60%</color>; CRIT DMG of other non-<color=#FFFFFF>[Armorer]</color> Characters in the team increases by <color=#POSITIVE_WITH_GREYITE>0%</color>, and CRIT Rate of <color=#FFFFFF>[Armorer]</color> Characters increases by <color=#POSITIVE_WITH_GREYITE>45%</color>, lasting until 30s after combat ends.

When another character in your squad is an <color=#FFFFFF>[Attack]</color> Character or <color=#FFFFFF>[Armorer]</color> Character:
Roxy's CRIT DMG increases by 10%. This effect scales with character Lv., increasing by 2% per level, up to a maximum increase of 130%;
